# The default model map, read at launch when no `models:` word is typed.
# Ticket 39 of the pilot-delivery map, every-worker-inherits-the-session-model,
# ruling 3. Starting value: every role on the session's own model, which is what
# every run and hunt did before the map existed.
#
# Grammar (ruling 5): `all`, `workers`, `gates`, or one key per agent type --
# implementer, escalated, verify, review, review-critical, finale, finder,
# fixer, claim-gate, fix-gate, fix-gate-critical, promotion, attacker, seam.
# More specific wins. Values: haiku, sonnet, opus, fable, inherit.
#
# `attacker` and `seam` are the two /harden-issues roles, and they sit inside
# `gates`. Ticket 33 of the pilot-delivery map, ruling 2, ruled by the human
# 2026-09-07; ticket 39 ruling 6 had deferred them here by name. A trial on
# cheaper models for those two is wanted later and is not set here today.
#
# A gate may never sit below the worker it checks (ruling 14). The launch line
# refuses an inverted map before it spawns anything.
all=inherit
